0.6 w 54.00 747.00 m 558.00 747.00 l S
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 716.00 Tm (Use a small, inspectable data model rather than a sprawling property warehouse. A SQLite database can hold) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 700.77 Tm (jurisdictions, parcels, parcel aliases, certificates, source documents, events, cash movements, and exceptions. Scope) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 685.55 Tm (every certificate key to its issuing jurisdiction and preserve the issuer's identifier verbatim. A tax year and parcel) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 670.32 Tm (number alone may not distinguish supplemental assessments, multiple instruments, or historical numbering changes.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 655.10 Tm (Store raw identifiers as text so leading zeros survive spreadsheet exports. Normalize spacing and punctuation into) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 639.87 Tm (separate matching fields, never over the evidence itself. For each imported row, record source URL, retrieval) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 624.65 Tm (timestamp, effective date when published, document hash, parser version, and original row number. Python's csv, json,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 609.42 Tm (hashlib, datetime, decimal, and sqlite3 modules are sufficient for this foundation. Store money as integer cents or exact) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 594.20 Tm (decimal text; do not let binary floating-point rounding drive settlement comparisons. Keep the immutable downloaded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 578.97 Tm (file beside the normalized tables under a controlled retention policy. An updated collector record creates a new) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 563.75 Tm (observation, not a silent replacement. The owner must be able to reconstruct what the desk knew when a bid was) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 548.52 Tm (authorized and what changed afterward.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 533.30 Tm (The waterfall begins with free authoritative exclusions: withdrawn certificates, incompatible instrument types, missing) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 518.07 Tm (parcel identity, unresolved sale eligibility, and payment deadlines the desk cannot meet. Next, join assessor and GIS) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 502.85 Tm (records to examine land use, improvements, parcel size, and boundary continuity. Match the county identifier first; use) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 487.62 Tm (legal descriptions and recorded references to investigate splits or mergers. Address similarity is supporting evidence,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 472.40 Tm (not a primary key. Only then buy commercial attributes that can change a bid or reduce expensive manual work. A) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 457.17 Tm (property value estimate may support triage, but it cannot establish recoverable equity without senior interests, costs,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 441.95 Tm (condition, and the governing distribution rules. Escalate survivors to recorded-document review, bankruptcy checks,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 426.72 Tm (and targeted environmental or access investigation. Stop enrichment when a decisive defect appears; retain the rejection) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 411.50 Tm (reason so the next sale does not trigger the same expense. Measure cost per accepted candidate and cost per funded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 396.27 Tm (certificate, not merely API cost per thousand records. For a 1 FT + 2 C pod, the research contractor works a bounded) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 381.05 Tm (exception queue while the owner controls the purchase threshold and the specialist resolves instrument-level) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 365.82 Tm (uncertainty.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 350.60 Tm (Attach freshness requirements to decisions rather than pretending that one daily refresh makes every field current.) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 335.37 Tm (Parcel geometry changes infrequently, but withdrawals and redemption postings can invalidate a bid or notice) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 320.15 Tm (immediately. Before submitting an auction instruction, recheck the sale status and the county's current settlement) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 304.92 Tm (directions. Before spending on a collection or foreclosure step, recheck the certificate balance, redemption status,) Tj ET
BT /F1 10.5 Tf 1 0 0 1 54.00 289.70 Tm (relevant docket, and procedural dates. Configure source-specific retry ceilings, bounded concurrency, and explicit) Tj ET
